Featuring Charu Suri, a pianist and composer who became the first Indian born jazz composer to debut work at Carnegie Hall;
@falsamusic, classically trained singer and translator of ancient Sufi (mystical/spiritual) poetry and music featured on NPR and New Sounds by John Schaefer (NY Public Radio); and
Jesse Gerbasi on vibraphone/drums.
Recorded/Mixed/Mastered at the State-of-the-Art Sound on Sound Studios (Montclair, NJ), it debuts August 5th everywhere! #morningragas #ragajazz

